<p>For a frame of reference, the 2026 combine class was the fastest on record, and its running backs still <a href="/fastest-nfl-rookies-2026-training-camp">averaged 4.45 seconds</a>. Walker's 4.38 from four years earlier beats that average by seven hundredths, while carrying more mass than most backs in that class.</p>
