</div>
<h2>Next Up: His Old Team on Sunday Night</h2>
<p>Week 7 sends the undefeated Chiefs to Seattle on Sunday Night Football, putting Walker across from the franchise he rushed for 3,555 yards and 29 touchdowns with over four seasons. It's also his toughest test yet: Seattle's defense leads the NFL in yards allowed per play. If Walker's yards-after-contact rate holds up against that front, it will say more about the durability of this start than any game so far.</p>
